Read-only credentials for the Fortinet and Zyxel gateways.
Lives ON THE JUMP BOX as ~/jumpbox-setup/.env (chmod 600). The laptop does not need it.
Format is "Username - x" / "Pass - x" under a section header; the scripts read it with awk.

Fortinet
Username - <read-only FortiGate admin>
Pass - <placeholder>

APT500
Username - <ATP500 limited-admin account>
Pass - <placeholder>

Full Admin accounts

APT500
Username - <ATP500 full admin, needs a Google Authenticator code>
Pass - <placeholder>

Zyxel
Username - <Nebula local admin>
Pass - <placeholder>
